_28":274,"_265":275,"_267":276,"_268":277},{"_261":262,"_13":263,"_28":264,"_265":266,"_267":21,"_268":269},"id","kpyky77mcvzioutjxxechv64i","PHP2Shell利用链分析：攻击者已入侵25台Palo Alto Networks设备","Dr. Johannes Ullrich 分析 CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619 的原理与 PHP2Shell 利用链，并披露攻击者已在美国、日本、台湾和韩国对 25 个系统取得 root，包括 24 台防火墙和 1 台管理服务器。","source",{"_56":270,"_271":269},"publishedAt","selected",false,"The Hacker News","firstParty","avypzdbdq1qojwu816bm9mjpx","Palo Alto Networks 修复已被利用的 PAN-OS Fragnesia 提权漏洞 CVE-2026-46300","Palo Alto Networks 发布 PAN-OS 更新，修复 Linux 内核 Fragnesia 提权漏洞 CVE-2026-46300。该漏洞影响 XFRM ESP-in-TCP 子系统，无权限攻击者可覆写敏感系统文件并获得 root 权限。",{"_56":278,"_271":269},"2026-11-25T08:12:24.000Z",true,"SecurityWeek","e6vclqnssenat6axpyd0r55su","Palo Alto Networks 确认 CVE-2026-46300 已被用于攻击互联网暴露的 PAN-OS 管理接口，攻击者先利用 PHP2Shell，再通过 Fragnesia Linux 内核提权漏洞取得防火墙 root 权限。",{"_56":282,"_271":269},"Infosecurity Magazine","iihzlri9yx0ljdqwxqduljzdy","Palo Alto Networks 确认 Fragnesia 漏洞 CVE-2026-46300 已用于攻击 PAN-OS 设备","Palo Alto Networks 通报 CVE-2026-46300（Fragnesia，Linux 内核 XFRM ESP-in-TCP 子系统漏洞）已被用于攻击将管理接口暴露在公网的 PAN-OS 设备，攻击者需先获得低权限本地访问权限方可提权至 root。",{"_56":288,"_271":269},"2026-11-25T22:05:09.000Z","BleepingComputer",{"_291":297,"_13":298,"_20":276,"_17":135,"_294":299},{"_291":292,"_13":293,"_20":21,"_17":155,"_294":295},"factId","fc3UQPEL9tf8","分析PHP2Shell利用链及设备风险","representative",{"_261":262,"_13":263,"_28":264,"_265":296,"_267":21,"_268":269},{"_56":270,"_271":269},"fls6PdC5HPDo","Palo Alto 修补 Fragnesia 内核漏洞",{"_261":272,"_13":273,"_28":274,"_265":300,"_267":276,"_268":277},{"_56":278,"_271":269},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_308":309,"_310":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
